{"4782250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cycling Champion", "steam_appid": 4782250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY KILOMETER IS A DECISION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cycling Champion</strong> is a fast-paced tactical cycling game where cards, energy management and timing decide every race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need an hour to experience the drama of a cycling stage. Races are condensed into short, tactical battles where every kilometer gives you another decision to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack too early and you may run out of energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait too long and your rivals could be gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every section of the race gives you a hand of action cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong> to break away from the peloton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move Up</strong> before an important climb or sprint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep the Pace</strong> and stay safely positioned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recover</strong> when your energy starts running low.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sprint</strong> when everything comes down to the final meters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards are limited, so every decision matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR ENERGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning isn't just about attacking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every effort costs energy, and pushing too hard can leave your rider completely exhausted before the finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the smartest move is to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it's to wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes you have to risk everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATTACK AT THE RIGHT MOMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountains, descents, flat roads and sprints create different tactical situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your rider's strengths, read the race and decide when to make your move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfectly timed attack can win a stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A badly timed one can lose an entire Tour.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras/4594b9f2aaeb92454fbbde544a6d6f11.poster.avif?t=1787737044\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras/4594b9f2aaeb92454fbbde544a6d6f11.webm?t=1787737044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras/4594b9f2aaeb92454fbbde544a6d6f11.mp4?t=1787737044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RACE A FULL CYCLING SEASON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your rider and compete across a season inspired by professional cycling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grand Tours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short stage races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-day Classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountain stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for stage victories, overall classification and the mountain jersey as you progress toward the biggest races of the season.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras/3e2d306a62c6b2ef86ad176cb8f438b8.avif?t=1787737044\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras_big/3e2d306a62c6b2ef86ad176cb8f438b8.avif?t=1787737044 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR RIDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different riders are built for different races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climbers thrive when the road goes uphill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprinters dominate fast finishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classics specialists shine on demanding one-day races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right rider for the challenge and make the most of their strengths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CYCLING WITHOUT THE WAITING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycling Champion captures the tactics and tension of professional cycling in short, accessible races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stage takes only a few minutes to play, making it easy to jump into another race while still giving every decision consequences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras/3e43513284d7db47ed6d6a0fd7d6088b.poster.avif?t=1787737044\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras/3e43513284d7db47ed6d6a0fd7d6088b.webm?t=1787737044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras/3e43513284d7db47ed6d6a0fd7d6088b.mp4?t=1787737044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast tactical cycling races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card-based decision making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy and fatigue management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grand Tours, stage races and Classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Season Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rider progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different rider specializations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized low-poly graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack. Recover. Sprint. Choose your moment and become the Cycling Champion.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY KILOMETER IS A DECISION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cycling Champion</strong> is a fast-paced tactical cycling game where cards, energy management and timing decide every race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need an hour to experience the drama of a cycling stage. Races are condensed into short, tactical battles where every kilometer gives you another decision to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack too early and you may run out of energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait too long and your rivals could be gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every section of the race gives you a hand of action cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong> to break away from the peloton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move Up</strong> before an important climb or sprint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep the Pace</strong> and stay safely positioned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recover</strong> when your energy starts running low.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sprint</strong> when everything comes down to the final meters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards are limited, so every decision matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR ENERGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning isn't just about attacking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every effort costs energy, and pushing too hard can leave your rider completely exhausted before the finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the smartest move is to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it's to wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes you have to risk everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATTACK AT THE RIGHT MOMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountains, descents, flat roads and sprints create different tactical situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your rider's strengths, read the race and decide when to make your move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfectly timed attack can win a stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A badly timed one can lose an entire Tour.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras/4594b9f2aaeb92454fbbde544a6d6f11.poster.avif?t=1787737044\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras/4594b9f2aaeb92454fbbde544a6d6f11.webm?t=1787737044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/extras/4594b9f2aaeb92454fbbde544a6d6f11.mp4?t=1787737044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RACE A FULL CYCLING SEASON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your rider and compete across a season inspired by professional cycling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grand Tours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short stage races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-day Classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountain stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for stage victories, overall classification and the mountain jersey as you progress toward the biggest races of the season.<br><s