=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy and fatigue management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grand Tours, stage races and Classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Season Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rider progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different rider specializations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized low-poly graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack. Recover. Sprint. Choose your moment and become the Cycling Champion.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A fast-paced tactical cycling game where every kilometer is a decision. Play your cards, manage your energy, time your attacks and fight for victory across Grand Tours, stage races and legendary Classics.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Dutch", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/84d2573e88ce02c45b566e4c6606bea875cba631/header.jpg?t=1787737044", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/517e1487a6e87a67a2b5f5bd4a68e93702d70e67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787737044", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782250/517e1487a6e87a67a2b5f5bd4a68e93702d70e67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787737044", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 / Intel HD Graphics 620 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB availab